  "marketplaceCacheBaseline_v0_30_0_issue88": {
    "note": "Reproduced baseline from GitHub issue #88: .codex-plugin/plugin.json (native) and plugins/dhpk/.codex-plugin/plugin.json (marketplace-target wrapper) both resolve their \"skills\" field to a codex/skills/ tree containing symlinks back to ../../skills/ (and, for the wrapper, a parent-relative \"../../codex/skills/\" path escaping the wrapper package directory entirely). A codex plugin installation into a clean marketplace cache copies the plugin tree without preserving those symlink targets and without resolving the parent-relative wrapper path, so the installed cache contains only the wrapper manifest.json and README.md — none of the 15 referenced skills materialize as physical, discoverable files.",
